{"id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion.md","title":"结构化前驱的递增穷尽","display":"thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion — 结构化前驱的递增穷尽","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion","aliases":["72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion"],"display":"thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion — 结构化前驱的递增穷尽","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal]]","[[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Thm.2.8(1–2); print155; PDF167","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion — 结构化前驱的递增穷尽"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c0b1d31927046ab\" href=\"?note=1c0b1d31927046ab\" title=\"72-df-structured-tree-ordinal\">72-df-structured-tree-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f09cae20e23b713\" href=\"?note=3f09cae20e23b713\" title=\"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain\">72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Thm.2.8(1–2); print155; PDF167"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\Omega,\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c0b1d31927046ab\" href=\"?note=1c0b1d31927046ab\" title=\"72-df-structured-tree-ordinal\">72-df-structured-tree-ordinal</a>；有限前驱链性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f09cae20e23b713\" href=\"?note=3f09cae20e23b713\" title=\"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain\">72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\\subseteq\\alpha[n+1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha[n]\\subseteq\\alpha[n+1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta\\in\\Omega\\ \\left(\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\ (\\beta\\in\\alpha[m])\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\beta\\in\\Omega\\ \\left(\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\ (\\beta\\in\\alpha[m])\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源是原书 Theorem 2.8 的两个分句及其证明，印刷 p.155 / PDF p.167；陈述和证明均已比对。</p>\n<p>证明第一式：对结构化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 归纳。零、后继分支直接用递归式及归纳假设。设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)\">\\(\\alpha=\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)\\)</span>；则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]=\\alpha_n[n]\\subseteq\\alpha_n[n+1]\">\\(\\alpha[n]=\\alpha_n[n]\\subseteq\\alpha_n[n+1]\\)</span>。结构化条件给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_n\\in\\alpha[n+1]\">\\(\\alpha_n\\in\\alpha[n+1]\\)</span>，有限前驱链引理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_n[n+1]\\subseteq\\alpha[n+1]\">\\(\\alpha_n[n+1]\\subseteq\\alpha[n+1]\\)</span>，于是得到包含。</p>\n<p>第二式的右推左由严格子树包含即得。反向仍作树归纳：后继分支中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 等于直接前驱或严格低于它，分别用新加的元素或归纳假设。极限分支中取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_i\">\\(\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_i\\)</span>；结构化条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_i\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}\">\\(\\alpha_i\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}\">\\(\\beta\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}\\)</span>。对子树用归纳假设取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_0\">\\(m_0\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\alpha_{i+1}[m_0]\">\\(\\beta\\in\\alpha_{i+1}[m_0]\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge\\max(m_0,i+2)\">\\(m\\ge\\max(m_0,i+2)\\)</span>；第一式给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\alpha_{i+1}[m]\">\\(\\beta\\in\\alpha_{i+1}[m]\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_{i+1}\\in\\alpha[i+2]\\subseteq\\alpha[m]\">\\(\\alpha_{i+1}\\in\\alpha[i+2]\\subseteq\\alpha[m]\\)</span>，有限前驱链引理遂给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\alpha[m]\">\\(\\beta\\in\\alpha[m]\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-structured-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"1c0b1d31927046ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain","status":"resolved","id":"3f09cae20e23b713","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-structured-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"1c0b1d31927046ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 见 [[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal]]；有限前驱链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。$\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s$，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain","status":"resolved","id":"3f09cae20e23b713","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 见 [[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal]]；有限前驱链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。$\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s$，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]\\subseteq\\alpha[n+1].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\beta\\in\\Omega\\ \\left(\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\ (\\beta\\in\\alpha[m])\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]=\\alpha_n[n]\\subseteq\\alpha_n[n+1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_n\\in\\alpha[n+1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_n[n+1]\\subseteq\\alpha[n+1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_i\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"m_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\alpha_{i+1}[m_0]","display":false},{"tex":"m\\ge\\max(m_0,i+2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\alpha_{i+1}[m]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_{i+1}\\in\\alpha[i+2]\\subseteq\\alpha[m]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\alpha[m]","display":false}],"bytes":2146,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a856779455ef3e1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\Omega,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 及前驱穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；$G,H,B,F$ 及前驱严格比较见 [[72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity]]。"},{"id":"47e3f5d82f726210","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\prec,\\preccurlyeq,\\alpha[n]$ 及前驱穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-258","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion|thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion — 结构化前驱的递增穷尽]]"},{"id":"8d01f06a62827a91","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 及递增穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；$G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|$ 与有限树序数 $\\overline k$ 见 [[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]]；$H,B,F$ 及有限迭代见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"1033b4b7928c3326","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1c0b1d31927046ab","3f09cae20e23b713"]}